<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Douglas Cty, Kan..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Douglas Cty, Kan..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc said it received the verbal award for the $4.620 million of Douglas County, Kan., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1997-1 with a top yield of 4.75 percent in 2002.</p>
